    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηδεστ-ής</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾱδεστάς</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			<u>AP</u>
			7.712
		</span></i> (<span class="entity">Erinna</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ὁ</span>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆδος, κηδεύω</span>): —<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>connexion by marriage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				773b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1312b16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cerc.
				17.25
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.555
			</span></i> (pl.), etc.; esp. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>son-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antipho
				6.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
