				D.
				19.118
			</span></i>, etc.; also, <i>step-father</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				36.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>brother-in-law</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
				834
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.50
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				13.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
